flowchart LR
  New[New in the app] --> T
  Chat[Chat start_session] --> T
  Enq[Chat enqueue, Add to queue] --> T
  Intake[Queue intake] --> T
  Issue[Issue with sub-issues] --> T
  T[Task with items] --> E[Queue entry names the Task]
  T --> X[TaskExecutor offers items]
  E --> X
  X --> D[Dispatcher: gates, capacity]
  D --> S[Session per item]
  S -->|add_step| T
  Steward -->|add_step| T
  You -->|Add step| T
  T --> P[Planning policy]
  P -->|rule asks| Inbox[Sign-off in the inbox]
  T --> M[App: WorkModel]
  Q[GET /api/queues] --> M
  Pool[GET /api/pool] --> M
  Sess[GET /api/sessions] --> M
  M --> L[List]
  M --> B[By queue]
  M --> Bd[Board]
  L --> Pane[Pane or Page]
  B --> Pane
  Bd --> Pane
